        // and checking exp extraction
        // Example: "1.23e4z" -> lastChar 'z' is not digit/dot. 
        // numeric = "1.23e4"
        // This part of the code is tricky: it checks if lastChar is a suffix.
        // If 'z' is passed, it hits default switch case and throws NFE.
